---
description:
  Verifies that setting flowchart.curve to 'rounded' produces smoothly rounded
  corners on edges that make right-angle turns, including the branching edges
  from a decision node that later reconverge at a shared end node.
config:
  flowchart:
    curve: rounded
---
flowchart TD
  A[Start] --> B{Decision}
